        {
            "title": "CrowdStrike洽購Zscaler，或催生網絡安全史上最大併購案——彭博",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"電信股因SpaceX收購頻譜消息而大跌\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/436bb1aee076a94b3f3eafa5d039207d62e395fae9f2673afda3183344be62ef/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEB0507V_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">電信股因SpaceX收購頻譜消息而大跌</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 據彭博社週五引述知情人士報導，CrowdStrike Holdings Inc（NASDAQ:CRWD）正就收購Zscaler Inc（NASDAQ:ZS）展開磋商。若此次交易最終達成，兩家公司合併後的市值將約達2,650億美元，有望躋身網絡安全行業史上規模最大的併購案之列。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">消息公佈後，CrowdStrike股價在週五盤後交易中大跌逾8%，而Zscaler則飆升超過15%。兩者走勢的強烈反差，反映出市場對Zscaler潛在收購溢價的期待，以及對收購方可能面臨股權攤薄與整合風險的顧慮。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-8a29f56f-b199-308b-9b09-174c8e340b08-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">目前，雙方的談判仍在進行中，或將很快達成協議，但交易能否最終落實仍存在不確定性。CrowdStrike市值約為2,330億美元，其核心產品Falcon平台專為筆記型電腦、伺服器等終端設備提供安全防護，是其市場地位的重要支柱。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Zscaler則專注於基於雲端的軟件解決方案，協助企業抵禦網絡威脅。受今年以來股價累計下跌13%影響，Zscaler目前市值約為320億美元，這也使其成為CrowdStrike擴展整體平台佈局的理想戰略補充資產。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">潛在併購消息在盤後交易中迅速波及整個網絡安全板塊。Palo Alto Networks Inc（NASDAQ:PANW）股價下跌逾3%，投資者對未來可能出現一個實力大幅增強的競爭對手表示擔憂。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">與此同時，Okta Inc（NASDAQ:OKTA）盤後小幅上漲近3%，Fortinet Inc（NASDAQ:FTNT）亦借勢上揚近2%。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/crowdstrike%E6%B4%BD%E8%B3%BCzscaler-%E6%88%96%E5%82%AC%E7%94%9F%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%B2%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%B5%E8%B3%BC%E6%A1%88-%E5%BD%AD%E5%8D%9A-222316208.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-21 06:31:20",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "國際｜特朗普總結亞洲行　稱中俄美達成和平宣言",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜特朗普總結亞洲行　稱中俄美達成和平宣言\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜特朗普總結亞洲行　稱中俄美達成和平宣言</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國總統特朗普結束亞洲訪問後在白宮見記者，總結此行成果。他形容日前在中國深圳舉行的亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議是十分成功的經濟會議，並指美、中、俄三國元首首次舉行三方會晤，會上氣氛熱烈，三人關係融洽。特朗普表示，是次峰會帶來一份前所未有的三方和平宣言，美、俄、中已正式達成共識，確保核衝突不會發生。</p></div>",
